    {
      "name": "otto_ads_update_campaign",
      "description": "Change a campaign: status (ACTIVE, PAUSED, WAITING), budget (euro cents), pacing, name, start or end date. Send only what changes; budgetType and campaignType cannot be changed. Read the campaign first: setting the status it already has is rejected. Asynchronous: poll otto_ads_get_change_request.",
